      "text": "Cluster management research shows that resource allocation is more than simple placement.\n\nBorg demonstrated policy-aware cluster management at very large scale, combining admission control, packing, monitoring and simulation tools.\n\nTiresias focused on distributed deep-learning jobs, where uncertain duration, multi-GPU demand and queue delay make general schedulers insufficient.\n\nGavel showed why hardware heterogeneity matters: different models perform differently across accelerator types, so allocation policy must be heterogeneity-aware.\n\nThese works motivate ARVA AI’s combination of workload evidence, constrained placement and alternative-plan evaluation.",
